  "transcript": " After the hearing, the substitute would die in custody. The real Daniel Yoon would vanish from the public record, and the man left in his place would become its final entry. The client wanted the case closed before anyone could compare the two stories. The plan assembled itself in her mind as a sequence of obligations. A transfer, a hearing, a death recorded under the wrong name. She did not think about the men who would pass through it. She thought about the report she would send when it was finished. She would need to be in San Francisco before Tuesday was over.",
